    <sys:String x:Key="SizeLimitWechat">WeChat ≤ 10MB</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="SizeLimitWechatTip">If the GIF is over 10MB, resolution is nudged to land close to the limit. Frame rate and heavier compression are used only if it still does not fit. Article columns are about 900px wide.</sys:String>
